=== 2a  the transferred threshold, on the axis it is entered on ===
`C-0221` section 5's rel axis is |v - 0.10| / 0.10; the corpus's `departure` is
|fine - coarse| / coarse.  For v near 0.10 the two are commensurate, so `C-0180`'s
4.57e-4 belongs on that axis as 4.57e-4 and NOT as 4.57e-3.
  within 0.00457    as published in C-0221 section 5      99
  within 0.000457   commensurate                           2
  C-0180 cell 69: departure 4.570659e-04, margin/value 4.273417e-03, ratio 9.3497  (its own '9.3')
  read as published the census puts the flip margin 4.2724e-3 at only 0.93 of the
  departure, where C-0180's own sentence puts it at 9.3 --- a factor of ten, visible
  in the channel ORDERING with no code run at all.

